Subject: [PATCH] feat(entities): translate Bedrock metadata and properties

Adapt the entity metadata work from ViaBedrock PR #327 to the current protocol and StackAnvil checkout. Keep it downstream because this patch is not intended for an upstream PR.

Track actor property definitions across configuration and play, resolve sparse values by their transmitted indices, and translate spawn values as well as later updates. Map cat variants through the Java registry because Bedrock uses a different order. Compose bee flags so nectar updates preserve anger. Add focused coverage for property definitions, sparse updates, and flag composition.
